.TH RFID-QUEUE-STATUS 1 "2026-08-30" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-queue-status \- show UID-safe RFID queue state
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-queue-status
.RI [ --json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rfid-queue-status
reports counts for active and historical RFID queue lanes and the mapped label
of the active or waiting interrupt command.
It does not print RFID card identifiers or queue event identifiers.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --json
Print structured status.
.TP
.BI "--queue-dir " DIR
Read queue records from DIR.
.TP
.BI "--runner-state " FILE
Read runner state from FILE.
.TP
.BI "--cards-dir " DIR
Resolve safe display labels from DIR.
.TP
.BI "--gadget-state " FILE
Read queue-aware gadget arm state from FILE.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-mode-runner (1),
.BR rfid-scan-publisher (1),
